<%# Relic Market shop header, shared by the shop labs: the shop name (heading), the signed-in customer and, when the page has one, the wallet with its data-cents hook. Lab content is English by design. Every value goes through the escaped output tag. Never put an EJS tag inside an EJS comment: it breaks parsing. %>
  <h1><%= heading %></h1>
  <p class="lab-note">Signed in as <code><%= customer.username %></code> (customer <code><%= customer.id %></code>, <%= customer.email %>).<% if (wallet) { %> Wallet: <strong data-testid="wallet" data-cents="<%= wallet.cents %>"><%= wallet.text %></strong><% } %></p>
